window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>It’s like a bad game of Telephone.</p> <p>Grant locates a murdered teen in McMinnville. He calls Jon.</p> <p>Jon locates the girl’s ghost. He calls Mack.</p> <p>Mack talks to the ghost who leads them to more ghosts. Who lead them to even more ghosts.</p> <p>And why are all the murder victims buried under trees?</p> <p>The boys are ready for this game to end, please. (Donovan especially.)</p>"; 
